== Description ==

'''Rifle Parts''' is a weapon assembly component in ''[[Human Host]]'', sourced from the world (loot, salvage, or base crafting). It appears as an ingredient in 4 downstream recipes at the [[Gunsmith Workbench]], including [[M1891 01]], [[M1A]], [[AKM]], [[FAMAS F1]]. See the ''Used in'' table for the full consumer list.

